{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25748","headline":"长安少年行 二 · 李廓","name":"长安少年行 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"追逐轻薄伴，闲游不着绯。\n长拢出猎马，数换打球衣。\n晓日寻花去，春风带酒归。\n青楼无昼夜，歌舞歇时稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李廓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}